---
source: crates/surfaces/cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Send an HTTP request under the project's effects ceiling: its answer as JSON, a declared secret attached by --secret and never shown (ADR 0339)

Usage: specforge http <COMMAND>

Commands:
  get     GET a URL
  head    HEAD a URL: its status and headers
  post    POST a body to a URL
  put     PUT a body to a URL
  patch   PATCH a URL with a body
  delete  DELETE a URL
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
